flowchart TD
    A[User opens MusicIP root] --> B[Open Discovery mode screen]
    B --> C{Discovery active?}
    C -- No --> D[Start discovery mode]
    D --> E[Reset stale state]
    E --> F[Load random songs from Kodi audio library]
    F --> G[Build initial playlist buffer]
    G --> H[Start Kodi playlist playback]
    H --> I[Service owns Discovery state]
    C -- Yes --> I

    I --> J[Track current playlist position]
    J --> K[Maintain queue]
    K --> L[Append future songs at end]
    K --> M[Prune top only after 10-song backlog]
    J --> N{Excerpt elapsed?}
    N -- Yes --> O[GoTo next playlist position]
    O --> J
    N -- No --> P[Continue playback]

    I --> Q{User action}
    Q --> R[Skip to next discovery song]
    R --> S[Direct Player.GoTo next]
    S --> T[Update current song and timer immediately]
    T --> J

    Q --> U[Generate mix from current discovery song]
    U --> V[Capture seed immediately]
    V --> W[Mix dialog hold]
    W --> X{User confirms?}
    X -- Yes --> Y[Stop Discovery mode]
    Y --> Z[Generate and play MusicIP mix]
    X -- No --> AA{Dialog time >= excerpt length?}
    AA -- Yes --> AB[Skip directly to next discovery song]
    AA -- No --> AC[Continue existing excerpt timer]

    Q --> AD[Stop discovery mode]
    AD --> AE[Disable Discovery state]
    AE --> AF[Stop playback and clear Discovery playlist]

    I --> AG{External playback takeover?}
    AG -- Yes --> AH[Disable Discovery only]
    AH --> AI[Leave external playback untouched]
    AG -- No --> J
